###
Initial access through a public SMB share containing a password-protected ZIP file.
The ZIP password is cracked using John.
Extraction reveals an encrypted PFX file, which is also cracked with John after converting it to a readable hash format.
An SSL certificate and private key are extracted from the PFX file. (WinRM via SSL)
These are used to authenticate to the system via WinRM.
A PowerShell history file is discovered, containing credentials for the svc_deploy account.
The svc_deploy user is part of the LAPS_Readers group.
This group allows reading local administrator passwords managed by LAPS.
The Administrator password is retrieved via LAPS.
Final access is obtained as Administrator through WinRM.
Crackmapexe doc: https://github.com/byt3bl33d3r/CrackMapExec/wiki/SMB-Command-Reference
